note: Words that scripts which are "part of: creature body" can use.
note: Each line is: the words = what they mean in C++, their type, and "read only" if a script may not change them.
note: Types are: number, yes or no, place, flat.

class: ACreatureBody
header: CreatureBody.h

fallen = bFallen, yes or no, read only
wandering = bWander, yes or no
time since standing up = SinceGetUpS, number, read only
settle time = GetUpSettleS, number, read only
centre of mass = ComputeStats().CenterOfMassCm, place, read only
heading = FMath::RadiansToDegrees(HeadingRad), number, read only
body facing = FMath::RadiansToDegrees(TrunkYawRad), number, read only
head turn = LookYawDeg, number
turn rate = TurnRateDegS, number
walk speed = WalkSpeedCmS, number
run speed = Gait.RunSpeedCmS, number, read only
frame time = GetWorld()->GetDeltaSeconds(), number, read only
